  "Dor anotada": ["Pain noted", "Dolor anotado", "已记录疼痛", "दर्द नोट हुआ", "Douleur notée"],
  "Senti dor": ["I felt pain", "Sentí dolor", "我感到疼", "दर्द हुआ", "J'ai eu mal"],
